{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"41b8f769-de8f-48c1-a6a1-c76088780f6f","step_index":55,"state":"DONE","step_type":"agent_response","text_delta":"/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/betMap.html#L389-L436), [`drawCrosshair()`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/betMap.html#L438-L466), [`updateReadout()`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/betMap.html#L468-L475), [`getStrategyColor()`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/betMap.html#L477-L482) | **2D Matrix Logic:**\u003cbr\u003e- Impossible: $c_T \u003c N \\implies \\text{pure white, } EV = 0$\u003cbr\u003e- $EV_{\\text{fold}} = S$\u003cbr\u003e- $EV_{\\text{cf}} = (1 - c_R)(S + P + B) + c_R(S - B)$\u003cbr\u003e- $EV_{\\text{cc}} = \\left(\\frac{c_T - c_R c_T}{c_T}\\right)(S + P + B) + \\left(\\frac{c_R c_T - N}{c_T}\\right)(2S + P)$\u003cbr\u003e**Color Mapping:** FOLD (`#333333`), CALL-FOLD (`#FF3030`), CALL-CALL (`#0047BB`).\u003cbr\u003e**Canvas Crosshair:** Pixel coordinate mapping of $(c_T, c_R)$ with synchronous readout overlay. | Section 4.4 (Section 3: PvBC 2D Strategy Heatmap); Section 5.2.2, Section 7.2; AC-01, AC-04. |\n| [`math.html`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/math.html) | Inputs: `in-pot`, `in-stack`, `in-freq`\u003cbr\u003eOutputs: `out-bet`, `out-alpha`, `out-rbluff`, `out-tbluff`\u003cbr\u003ePopover: `#popover-anchor`, `#card-inner`, `#info-title`, `#info-body`, `.info-chip`, `.card-face`\u003cbr\u003eData: `dataMap` (`ggop`, `alpha`, `recursive`)\u003cbr\u003eFunctions: [`calculate()`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/math.html#L318-L344), [`randomizeCard()`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/math.html#L384-L397), [`closePopover()`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/math.html#L464-L467) | **GGOP Math Engine:**\u003cbr\u003e- $\\text{Growth } R = \\frac{P + 2S}{P}$\u003cbr\u003e- $\\text{Street Ratio } = \\sqrt{R}$\u003cbr\u003e- $\\text{Bet } \\% = \\frac{\\sqrt{R} - 1}{2}$\u003cbr\u003e- $\\alpha = \\frac{\\text{Bet}}{1 + 2\\text{Bet}}$\u003cbr\u003e- River Bluff Combos \u0026 Turn Bluff Combos recursive allocation.\u003cbr\u003e**3D Anchored Card Popover:** Target-anchored position calculation, 3D card flip on click, click-outside listener, and dynamic KaTeX rendering via `renderMathInElement`. | Section 4.5 (Section 4: Equilibrium Constructor \u0026 GGOP Engine); Section 5.2.3, Section 7.4; AC-01, AC-05, AC-06. |\n| [`BluffingMath.html`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/BluffingMath.html) | Elements: `.interactive-zone`, `#exp-title`, `#exp-body`\u003cbr\u003eData: `data` (`cost`, `numerator`, `denominator`)\u003cbr\u003eBackground: `.blob-cont`, `.blob`\u003cbr\u003eCard: `.glass-card`, `.fraction`, `.fraction-bar` | **Equation 11.7 Hover Inspection:**\u003cbr\u003e- Cost Zone: $\\frac{B}{B + P}$\u003cbr\u003e- Numerator Zone: $F_T - F_T E_f$\u003cbr\u003e- Denominator Zone: $1 - E_s$\u003cbr\u003e**Interactive Drawer:** Mouseenter event handlers updating title and rich HTML explanation without flickering. | Section 4.6 (Section 5: Bluffing Efficiency Math Breakdown); AC-01, AC-07. |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Required Behavior Absence Register\n\nThe static scan verified that the following behaviors specified in [`functional_specification_001.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/functional_specification_001.md) currently have **zero